    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77346" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰν-είκελος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			= foreg., <i><span class="en">
			Opp.
			<u>C.</u>
			1.434
		</span></i>: c. dat., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλακτι π. ῥεύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.699
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				12.156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				2.423
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Macedonia</span>): also c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχὼρ π. γάλακτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>L.</u>
					203
				</span></i>
			: neut. as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
				2079.31
			</span></i>.</div>
